<title>UK: ATHLETICS-PINTO WINS MEN'S LONDON MARATHON.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-PINTO WINS MEN'S LONDON MARATHON.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Antonio Pinto of Portugal won the men's London marathon on Sunday in an unofficial time of 2 hours 07 minutes and 55 seconds.  </p>
<p>Italian Stefano Baldini came second and Josia Thugwane of South Africa finished third.</p>
</text>
